"<div><h3>Imagen de marca</h3><p class=\"meta\">Con esto salen las imágenes de los posts, y todos los agentes lo leen antes de trabajar. Lo que dejes vacío sale con el diseño de siempre.</p></div>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Así quedan las imágenes</legend><img class=\"marca-muestra\" alt=\"Muestra de la imagen de un post\"></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Logo</legend><div class=\"marca-logo\"><img alt=\"Logo en uso\" src=\"{0}/marca/logo?v={1}\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"><label class=\"btn sec peq\">Subir logo<input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/svg+xml\" data-marca-logo hidden></label>{2}</div><p class=\"meta\">PNG, JPG o SVG, hasta 2 MB. Mejor en horizontal y con fondo transparente.</p></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Colores</legend><div class=\"marca-colores\">{3}</div></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Letra</legend><label>Letra de los titulares en las imágenes<select name=\"letra\"><option value=\"serif\"{4}>Con remates (Playfair Display)</option><option value=\"sans\"{5}>Sin remates (Inter)</option></select></label>{6}</fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Textos de la imagen</legend>{7}{8}{9}</fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Normas de uso</legend><label>Cómo se usa la marca<textarea name=\"normas\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"4000\" placeholder=\"{10}\">{11}</textarea></label></fieldset>\n    <p class=\"conf-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button><button class=\"btn sec\" type=\"button\" data-acc=\"original\">Volver al diseño original</button><button class=\"btn sec\" type=\"button\" data-acc=\"cerrar\">Cerrar</button></div>":"<div><h3>Brand identity</h3><p class=\"meta\">Post images are made with this, and every agent reads it before working. Whatever you leave empty keeps the usual design.</p></div>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>How the images look</legend><img class=\"marca-muestra\" alt=\"Sample post image\"></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Logo</legend><div class=\"marca-logo\"><img alt=\"Current logo\" src=\"{0}/marca/logo?v={1}\" onerror=\"this.remove()\"><label class=\"btn sec peq\">Upload logo<input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/svg+xml\" data-marca-logo hidden></label>{2}</div><p class=\"meta\">PNG, JPG or SVG, up to 2 MB. Ideally landscape with a transparent background.</p></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Colours</legend><div class=\"marca-colores\">{3}</div></fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Typeface</legend><label>Headline typeface in images<select name=\"letra\"><option value=\"serif\"{4}>Serif (Playfair Display)</option><option value=\"sans\"{5}>Sans serif (Inter)</option></select></label>{6}</fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Image text</legend>{7}{8}{9}</fieldset>\n    <fieldset class=\"perfil\"><legend>Usage rules</legend><label>How the brand is used<textarea name=\"normas\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"4000\" placeholder=\"{10}\">{11}</textarea></label></fieldset>\n    <p class=\"conf-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save</button><button class=\"btn sec\" type=\"button\" data-acc=\"original\">Back to the original design</button><button class=\"btn sec\" type=\"button\" data-acc=\"cerrar\">Close</button></div>",
