"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">Pasarme llamadas</h4>\n    <p class=\"det-tarea\">Si quien llama pide hablar con una persona y estás en tu horario, Lola te pasa la llamada al móvil y, justo antes, te llega por Telegram lo que sabemos de él.</p>\n    <p class=\"det-tarea li-estado\">{0}{1}</p>\n    <form class=\"voz-pasar-form\"><label class=\"presu-turbo\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"activo\"{2}> <span>Pasarme llamadas</span></label>\n      <label>Móvil <input name=\"movil\" value=\"{3}\" inputmode=\"tel\" placeholder=\"606…\" style=\"width:120px\"></label>\n      <label>De <input name=\"desde\" type=\"time\" value=\"{4}\"></label><label>a <input name=\"hasta\" type=\"time\" value=\"{5}\"></label>\n      <span class=\"voz-dias\">{6}</span>\n      <button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button></form>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><span class=\"meta\">No molestar:</span>{7}</div>":"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">Put calls through to me</h4>\n    <p class=\"det-tarea\">If the caller asks to speak to a person and you're within your hours, Lola transfers the call to your mobile and, just before, you get what we know about them on Telegram.</p>\n    <p class=\"det-tarea li-estado\">{0}{1}</p>\n    <form class=\"voz-pasar-form\"><label class=\"presu-turbo\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"activo\"{2}> <span>Put calls through to me</span></label>\n      <label>Mobile <input name=\"movil\" value=\"{3}\" inputmode=\"tel\" placeholder=\"606…\" style=\"width:120px\"></label>\n      <label>From <input name=\"desde\" type=\"time\" value=\"{4}\"></label><label>a <input name=\"hasta\" type=\"time\" value=\"{5}\"></label>\n      <span class=\"voz-dias\">{6}</span>\n      <button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Save</button></form>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><span class=\"meta\">Do not disturb:</span>{7}</div>",
