"<details class=\"cal-ext cal-rec\"><summary>⏰ Añadir un recordatorio o una cita este día</summary>\n    <form class=\"form-prog\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><div class=\"fila\"><input type=\"date\" name=\"dia\" required value=\"{0}\"><input type=\"time\" name=\"hora\" placeholder=\"Hora (opcional)\"><input name=\"texto\" required placeholder=\"Qué (p. ej. «Llamar a la gestoría Pérez», «Feria en el Palacio de Congresos»)\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:200px;font:inherit;padding:4px 6px\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Añadir</button></div>\n    <p class=\"recom\">A su hora (o a las 9:00 si no le pones hora) te llega el aviso por Telegram y en la actividad.</p></form></details>":"<details class=\"cal-ext cal-rec\"><summary>⏰ Add a reminder or an appointment on this day</summary>\n    <form class=\"form-prog\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><div class=\"fila\"><input type=\"date\" name=\"dia\" required value=\"{0}\"><input type=\"time\" name=\"hora\" placeholder=\"Time (optional)\"><input name=\"texto\" required placeholder=\"What (e.g. “Call the Pérez accounting firm”, “Fair at the Conference Centre”)\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:200px;font:inherit;padding:4px 6px\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Add</button></div>\n    <p class=\"recom\">At that time (or at 9:00 if you don't set one) you'll get the alert on Telegram and in the activity feed.</p></form></details>",
"<details class=\"cal-ext\"><summary>📌 Apuntar un post que ya tengo programado en LinkedIn o Facebook</summary>\n    <form class=\"form-prog\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><p class=\"recom\">La oficina no puede ver lo que programas directamente en LinkedIn. Apúntalo aquí y ni la recomendación ni Álex pisarán ese día ni ese tema.</p>\n    <div class=\"fila\"><select name=\"canal\"><option value=\"linkedin\">LinkedIn</option><option value=\"facebook\">Facebook</option></select><input type=\"datetime-local\" name=\"cuando\" required value=\"{0}T10:00\"><input name=\"titulo\" placeholder=\"De qué va (título corto)\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:160px;font:inherit;padding:4px 6px\"></div>\n    <textarea name=\"texto\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Opcional: pega el texto del post para que Álex no repita el tema\" style=\"font:inherit;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"></textarea>\n    <div class=\"fila\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Apuntar</button><span class=\"ext-err\" style=\"color:#b42318;font-size:12px\"></span></div></form></details>":"<details class=\"cal-ext\"><summary>📌 Note down a post I've already scheduled on LinkedIn or Facebook</summary>\n    <form class=\"form-prog\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><p class=\"recom\">The office can't see what you schedule directly on LinkedIn. Note it here and neither the recommendation nor Álex will step on that day or topic.</p>\n    <div class=\"fila\"><select name=\"canal\"><option value=\"linkedin\">LinkedIn</option><option value=\"facebook\">Facebook</option></select><input type=\"datetime-local\" name=\"cuando\" required value=\"{0}T10:00\"><input name=\"titulo\" placeholder=\"What it's about (short title)\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:160px;font:inherit;padding:4px 6px\"></div>\n    <textarea name=\"texto\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Optional: paste the post text so Álex doesn't repeat the topic\" style=\"font:inherit;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"></textarea>\n    <div class=\"fila\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Note it down</button><span class=\"ext-err\" style=\"color:#b42318;font-size:12px\"></span></div></form></details>",
