"<div class=\"presu\"><h3 class=\"gd-tit\">Presupuesto de IA</h3>\n    <p class=\"presu-total\"><b>{0} € de {1} €</b> {2}{3}{4}</p>\n    <div class=\"acciones presu-botones\"><span class=\"meta\">Empujón:</span><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"5\">+5 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"10\">+10 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"25\">+25 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"50\">+50 €</button>\n      <button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-este=\"0\">{5}: nada (vacaciones)</button>{6}</div>\n    <form class=\"presu-form\" data-presu-form><label>Tope normal <input name=\"eur\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"{7}\"> €</label><select name=\"modo\" aria-label=\"Periodo\"><option value=\"semanal\"{8}>por semana</option><option value=\"mensual\"{9}>al mes</option></select><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button></form>\n    <form class=\"presu-form\" data-presu-creditos><label>Créditos de Claude de tu plan <input name=\"creditos\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"{10}\" placeholder=\"p. ej. 100\"> $ al mes</label><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button>\n      <span class=\"meta\">{11}</span></form>\n    <label class=\"presu-turbo\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-presu-turbo{12}> <span>🚀 <b>Modo turbo</b>: Lucía busca sin parar y Mateo y Carmen puntúan y preparan dossiers sin topes diarios (y trabajan más agentes a la vez), hasta agotar el presupuesto {13}. Contactar sigue siendo cosa tuya.</span></label></div>":"<div class=\"presu\"><h3 class=\"gd-tit\">AI budget</h3>\n    <p class=\"presu-total\"><b>€{0} of €{1}</b> {2}{3}{4}</p>\n    <div class=\"acciones presu-botones\"><span class=\"meta\">Boost:</span><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"5\">+5 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"10\">+10 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"25\">+25 €</button><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-extra=\"50\">+50 €</button>\n      <button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"button\" data-presu-este=\"0\">{5}: nothing (holidays)</button>{6}</div>\n    <form class=\"presu-form\" data-presu-form><label>Normal cap <input name=\"eur\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"{7}\"> €</label><select name=\"modo\" aria-label=\"Period\"><option value=\"semanal\"{8}>per week</option><option value=\"mensual\"{9}>per month</option></select><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Save</button></form>\n    <form class=\"presu-form\" data-presu-creditos><label>Claude credits in your plan <input name=\"creditos\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"{10}\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\"> $ per month</label><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"submit\">Save</button>\n      <span class=\"meta\">{11}</span></form>\n    <label class=\"presu-turbo\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-presu-turbo{12}> <span>🚀 <b>Turbo mode</b>: Lucía searches non-stop and Mateo and Carmen score and prepare dossiers with no daily limits (and more agents work at once), until the budget runs out {13}. Contacting is still up to you.</span></label></div>",
