"<h3 class=\"gd-tit\">Consumo de IA</h3><table class=\"gd-tabla\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"num\">Hoy</th><th class=\"num\">Esta semana</th><th class=\"num\">Este mes</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n      <tr><td><b>Total</b></td>{0}</tr>\n      <tr><td>Llamadas a la IA</td>{1}</tr>\n      {2}\n      {3}</tbody></table>\n      {4}\n      <p class=\"meta\">Lo de <b>Claude</b> sale de los créditos de API que trae tu plan cada mes (míralos en platform.claude.com → Billing); lo de <b>OpenRouter</b>, de tu saldo allí. El tope de arriba solo cuenta lo que pagas de verdad: OpenRouter y lo de Claude que pase de los créditos.</p>\n      <p class=\"meta\">Con Claude, el coste de cada llamada se calcula con los precios oficiales a partir de los tokens que devuelve la API, así se sabe qué agente lo gasta (la Console de Claude enseña el total, pero no por agente). Puede diferir unos céntimos de la Console.</p>":"<h3 class=\"gd-tit\">AI usage</h3><table class=\"gd-tabla\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"num\">Today</th><th class=\"num\">This week</th><th class=\"num\">This month</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n      <tr><td><b>Total</b></td>{0}</tr>\n      <tr><td>AI calls</td>{1}</tr>\n      {2}\n      {3}</tbody></table>\n      {4}\n      <p class=\"meta\"><b>Claude</b> usage comes out of the API credits your plan includes each month (see them at platform.claude.com → Billing); <b>OpenRouter</b> usage, from your balance there. The cap above only counts what you actually pay: OpenRouter and any Claude usage beyond the credits.</p>\n      <p class=\"meta\">With Claude, the cost of each call is calculated with the official prices from the tokens the API returns, so we know which agent spends it (the Claude Console shows the total, but not per agent). It may differ from the Console by a few cents.</p>",
