"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">LinkedIn</h4><p class=\"det-tarea\">Para publicar tus posts en LinkedIn, pega el <b>Client ID</b> y el <b>Primary Client Secret</b> de tu app. Se guardan cifrados.</p>\n  <form class=\"det-form\" data-form=\"li-app\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"cid\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Client ID\" aria-label=\"Client ID de LinkedIn\"><input type=\"password\" name=\"s\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Primary Client Secret\" aria-label=\"Primary Client Secret de LinkedIn\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Guardar</button></form>":"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">LinkedIn</h4><p class=\"det-tarea\">To publish your posts on LinkedIn, paste your app's <b>Client ID</b> and <b>Primary Client Secret</b>. They're stored encrypted.</p>\n  <form class=\"det-form\" data-form=\"li-app\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"cid\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Client ID\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn Client ID\"><input type=\"password\" name=\"s\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Primary Client Secret\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn Primary Client Secret\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Save</button></form>",
"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">Cuentas de correo</h4><p class=\"det-tarea\">Desde las que puede salir un correo. En cada envío eliges cuál.</p>":"<h4 class=\"det-sub\">Email accounts</h4><p class=\"det-tarea\">Emails can go out from these. You choose which one each time.</p>",
"<details><summary class=\"meta\">＋ Añadir una cuenta</summary><form class=\"correo-form\" data-form=\"cuenta\"><label>Nombre que verá quien lo reciba<input name=\"nombre\" placeholder=\"Tu empresa\"></label><label>Dirección<input name=\"direccion\" type=\"email\" required></label><label>Contraseña del correo<input name=\"clave\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" required></label><details><summary class=\"meta\">Servidores, si no es de Hostinger ni de Gmail</summary><label>Salida (SMTP)<input name=\"smtp\" placeholder=\"smtp.ejemplo.com:465\"></label><label>Entrada (IMAP)<input name=\"imap\" placeholder=\"imap.ejemplo.com:993\"></label></details><label class=\"correo-fila\"><input name=\"leer\" type=\"checkbox\"> Que la oficina lea su buzón y vea las respuestas (los marca como leídos)</label><div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Comprobar y guardar</button></div></form></details>":"<details><summary class=\"meta\">＋ Add an account</summary><form class=\"correo-form\" data-form=\"cuenta\"><label>Name the recipient will see<input name=\"nombre\" placeholder=\"Your company\"></label><label>Address<input name=\"direccion\" type=\"email\" required></label><label>Email password<input name=\"clave\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" required></label><details><summary class=\"meta\">Servers, if it's not Hostinger or Gmail</summary><label>Outgoing (SMTP)<input name=\"smtp\" placeholder=\"smtp.ejemplo.com:465\"></label><label>Incoming (IMAP)<input name=\"imap\" placeholder=\"imap.ejemplo.com:993\"></label></details><label class=\"correo-fila\"><input name=\"leer\" type=\"checkbox\"> Let the office read its inbox and see the replies (it marks them as read)</label><div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Check and save</button></div></form></details>",
