"<button type=\"button\" class=\"ap-ampliar\" data-ampliar title=\"Ampliar: verla sola y en grande\" aria-label=\"Ampliar esta tarjeta\">⤢</button>{0}<div>{1}<p>{2} {3}</p>{4}\n    <div class=\"acciones\">{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}<button class=\"btn rosa\" type=\"button\" data-r=\"gracias\" title=\"Dar las gracias\">💛</button></div>\n    <form class=\"cambios\" data-modo=\"cambios\" hidden><textarea rows=\"3\" name=\"t\" aria-label=\"Texto para {10}\"></textarea><div><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Enviar</button></div></form>{11}{12}</div>":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"ap-ampliar\" data-ampliar title=\"Enlarge: see it on its own and big\" aria-label=\"Enlarge this card\">⤢</button>{0}<div>{1}<p>{2} {3}</p>{4}\n    <div class=\"acciones\">{5}{6}{7}{8}{9}<button class=\"btn rosa\" type=\"button\" data-r=\"gracias\" title=\"Say thanks\">💛</button></div>\n    <form class=\"cambios\" data-modo=\"cambios\" hidden><textarea rows=\"3\" name=\"t\" aria-label=\"Text for {10}\"></textarea><div><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"submit\">Send</button></div></form>{11}{12}</div>",
"<h3>📧 Enviar este correo</h3><form class=\"correo-form\" data-correo-form>\n    <label>Desde<select name=\"cuenta\">{0}</select></label>\n    <label>Para<input name=\"para\" type=\"email\" required value=\"{1}\" list=\"correo-dirs\"><datalist id=\"correo-dirs\">{2}</datalist></label>\n    <label>Asunto<input name=\"asunto\" required maxlength=\"200\" value=\"{3}\"></label>\n    <label>Texto<textarea name=\"texto\" rows=\"11\" required>{4}</textarea></label>\n    {5}\n    <div class=\"correo-fila\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"formato\" value=\"diseno\"{6}> Con el diseño de la empresa</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"formato\" value=\"texto\"{7}> Texto sencillo</label><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"button\" data-correo-vista>👁 Ver cómo queda</button></div>\n    <div data-correo-previa></div>\n    <p class=\"correo-aviso\" data-correo-aviso hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">📧 Enviar ahora</button></div></form>":"<h3>📧 Send this email</h3><form class=\"correo-form\" data-correo-form>\n    <label>From<select name=\"cuenta\">{0}</select></label>\n    <label>To<input name=\"para\" type=\"email\" required value=\"{1}\" list=\"correo-dirs\"><datalist id=\"correo-dirs\">{2}</datalist></label>\n    <label>Subject<input name=\"asunto\" required maxlength=\"200\" value=\"{3}\"></label>\n    <label>Message<textarea name=\"texto\" rows=\"11\" required>{4}</textarea></label>\n    {5}\n    <div class=\"correo-fila\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"formato\" value=\"diseno\"{6}> With the company's design</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"formato\" value=\"texto\"{7}> Plain text</label><button class=\"btn sec peq\" type=\"button\" data-correo-vista>👁 See how it looks</button></div>\n    <div data-correo-previa></div>\n    <p class=\"correo-aviso\" data-correo-aviso hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">📧 Send now</button></div></form>",
"⚠️ Ahora mismo no se puede enviar desde {0}: {1}":"⚠️ You can't send from {0} right now: {1}",
"<div class=\"det-cab\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"{0}\"><div><h3>📞 Llamar a {1}</h3><p>{2} · ellos verán el número de la oficina</p></div></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-presenta\" data-llam-presenta hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones llam-modos\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-llam-movil>📱 Que me suene el móvil{3}</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-llam-web>💻 Llamar desde el ordenador</button></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-estado\" data-llam-estado hidden></p><div class=\"llam-telweb\" data-llam-telweb></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-consejo\" data-llam-consejo hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"llam-emp\" data-llam-emp></div>\n    {4}\n    <h4>Notas mientras hablas <span class=\"meta\">(opcional)</span></h4>\n    <textarea class=\"llam-notas\" data-sin-borrador rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Quién te ha cogido, cuándo está, qué te ha dicho…\"></textarea>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-llam-guardar{5}>Guardar notas</button><span class=\"meta\" data-llam-ok></span></div>\n    <p class=\"meta\">Al colgar no tienes que marcar nada: en unos minutos llega la transcripción, Paula la resume y {6}.</p>":"<div class=\"det-cab\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"{0}\"><div><h3>📞 Call {1}</h3><p>{2} · they will see the office number</p></div></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-presenta\" data-llam-presenta hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"acciones llam-modos\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-llam-movil>📱 Ring my mobile{3}</button><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-llam-web>💻 Call from the computer</button></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-estado\" data-llam-estado hidden></p><div class=\"llam-telweb\" data-llam-telweb></div>\n    <p class=\"llam-consejo\" data-llam-consejo hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"llam-emp\" data-llam-emp></div>\n    {4}\n    <h4>Notes while you talk <span class=\"meta\">(optional)</span></h4>\n    <textarea class=\"llam-notas\" data-sin-borrador rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Who picked up, when they're available, what they said…\"></textarea>\n    <div class=\"acciones\"><button class=\"btn peq\" type=\"button\" data-llam-guardar{5}>Save notes</button><span class=\"meta\" data-llam-ok></span></div>\n    <p class=\"meta\">After hanging up you don't need to mark anything: in a few minutes the transcript arrives, Paula summarises it and {6}.</p>",
